{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13462","headline":"积雪爲小山 · 刘眘虚","name":"积雪爲小山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞雪伴春还，春庭晓自闲。\n虚心应任道，遇赏遂成山。\n峰小形全秀，岩虚势莫攀。\n以幽能皎洁，谓近可循环。\n孤影临冰境，寒光对玉颜。\n不随迟日尽，留顾岁华间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘眘虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13462.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13462","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}